{"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputat\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This operator is an alias for ","type":"text"},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", providing identical behavior.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt\/share()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113","fileName":"ShareSequence.swift"},"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8OutputAtV","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"share()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","title":"Afluent","role":"collection","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","abstract":[{"text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AsyncSequences"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/OutputAt":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputat","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"AsyncSequences.OutputAt","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OutputAt","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OutputAt","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence